# Colony fixture — asserted graph layer for TestColonyGraph / TestColonyPageEmbedsGraph.
# Creature nodes slime-auth / orc-core / elf-voice / rimuru are minted by derive from the
# typed dirs; this file carries the asserted bond chain + the shared mind the derived
# layer cannot mint (host-skill tdd is CLAUDE-only; the graph must still name a shared mind).
# Law-trumps over the elf sketch (2026-10-04-colony-graph-fixture-verdict.md): rimuru has
# NO is:name line here (derive mints its own), prefix is the world's <isekai:>, and the
# chain rides truth/verdict/reports — never after.
@prefix is: <isekai:> .

is:slime-auth is:truth   is:orc-core .
is:orc-core   is:verdict is:elf-voice .
is:elf-voice  is:reports is:rimuru    .

is:slime-auth is:wears is:mind-tdd .
is:mind-tdd a is:mind ; is:shared "true" .

